    "text": "Leave a 🤍 below to affirm! To close out Mental Health Awareness Month, we’ve partnered with @GreenlightCard, the number one family finance and safety app.\n\nA lot of us carry financial stress, mental load, caregiving responsibilities, burnout, and uncertainty all at once, while still showing up for the people we love. That’s not a weakness to be overwhelmed by that; it’s deeply human.\n\nYou don’t have to do this all alone, love. You deserve support during seasons like this.\n\nGreenlight was built for families. It takes a few things off your plate, so your family learns, earns, saves, and stays safe together. And you get a little of yourself back. One less thing to hold. A little more room to breathe.\n\nWant to try it for your family? Use code TRYGREENLIGHT for 3 months of their Infinity plan.\n\n#ad. Influencers - Paid non-client endorsement/testimonial. Tier V influencer. Compensation and additional details can be found at https://greenlight.com/influencer-details",
